{"581310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Riskers", "steam_appid": 581310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [732120], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minimalist Arcade Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Riskers</strong> is a minimalist arcade action game built around speed, precision, and player skill. Each session drops you into a fast-moving challenge where survival depends entirely on your reactions and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no complex systems to learn — just immediate, demanding gameplay that rewards mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast, High-Risk Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay in Riskers is designed to be intense and unforgiving. Mistakes are punished quickly, encouraging players to learn patterns, improve reflexes, and push for higher scores with each attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs are short and repeatable, making the game ideal for quick sessions or extended score-chasing marathons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clean Visuals, Pure Focus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The minimalist presentation keeps the focus entirely on gameplay. Clean visuals and simple effects ensure clarity even at high speeds, reinforcing the game’s arcade roots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riskers is a <strong>single-player experience</strong> aimed at players who enjoy challenging reflex games and classic arcade design.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist arcade action gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, reflex-driven challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score-focused design built for replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short sessions with escalating difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean visuals emphasizing gameplay clarity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player arcade experience</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 cl